## Why the split

The code is genuinely meant to be reused — take it, fork it, ship it. The
content is roughly 54,000 words of hand-written bilingual copy plus a
large body of FAQ prose, and it is the part that a scraper would lift
verbatim to stand up a duplicate site. Splitting the licenses keeps the code
open without making that free.

If you want to use the content, open an issue and ask. The answer is often yes.
